The release binary lives here: `save.bat build` copies it out of
target\release\.

    TelegramTools.exe    the window with no arguments; `analyse ...` and the
                         exporter's commands (login, chats, export, ...)
                         from a terminal

It replaced TelegramExporter.exe and TelegramAnalyser.exe; `save.bat build`
removes either if it finds one here.

It sits in the repo rather than in target\ because target\ is a build
directory -- `cargo clean` empties it -- and because the app keeps its state
beside its executable. Running dist\TelegramTools.exe therefore puts
dist\TelegramToolsData\ and dist\Exports\ next to it, which is what makes the
folder portable: copy dist\ anywhere and it works, credentials and all.

Everything in here except this file is gitignored, for that last reason.
